      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We had a 5.5 kWh system put in by the Sorell branch of Marshall Solar. No issues there. The system is good and the installation was fine, BUT, twice our inverter has gone off with a fault message to contact the company. We do this and are told they will be there the next day. They dont show up. We repeat, and repeat. So far this time it has bern 10 days, with a phone call to them almost every day. They are running out of their list of excuses. Meanwhile it is costing us money as we have no solar power. So unimpressed. System is still under warranty. Service is as important as quality of insyallation. Certainly will not be recommending this company",
